---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Parque de Maquinaria y Flota Propia - Quintanamur S.L."
  description="Flota Fendt 933, Fendt 930, Fendt 722, Fendt 211, Retropala Mixta, Fresadora FI-IVAN y guiado satelital GPS Topcon. Maquinaria propia sin intermediarios."
  activePage="maquinaria"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <header class="bg-inverse-surface text-on-primary py-24 md:py-32 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat pointer-events-none"
      style="background-image: url('/images/maquinaria/hero-flota-bg.webp');"
    >
      <!-- Gradient overlay: strong dark tone on text side, completely open on machinery side -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-inverse-surface via-inverse-surface/85 to-inverse-surface/40 md:to-transparent"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center">
      <div class="w-full md:w-7/12 lg:w-1/2">
        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-widest block mb-4">
          Parque de Maquinaria Propio
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-display-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg lg:text-[60px] font-extrabold mb-5 text-on-primary leading-tight">
          NUESTRA FLOTA:<br />
          <span class="text-primary-fixed-dim">POTENCIA INDUSTRIAL</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg md:text-[19px] text-inverse-on-surface max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Al servicio de la obra civil y las labores agrícolas más exigentes. Tecnología alemana Fendt y operarios con experiencia real en los terrenos más duros.
        </p>
        <div>
          <a
            href="#categoria-a"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-primary hover:bg-verde-oscuro text-on-primary px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-label-caps text-label-caps tracking-wider shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 group"
          >
            <span>VER FLOTA DE TRACTORES</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg group-hover:translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">arrow_downward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Strategic Advantage (Versatilidad Operativa) -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop bg-surface max-w-max-width mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12 sharp-shadow">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">verified</span>
        <span class="uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Ventaja Estratégica</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-6 border-l-4 border-primary pl-4 leading-tight">
        VERSATILIDAD OPERATIVA: El secreto de nuestro rendimiento
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        En Quintanamur S.L. operamos con un parque de maquinaria propio de primer nivel. Entendemos que la robustez no está reñida con la precisión. Toda la maquinaria pesada y tractores que utilizamos para la exigente obra civil se emplea también en nuestros trabajos agrícolas, garantizando una eficiencia y amortización que trasladamos a la competitividad de nuestros presupuestos.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-6 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 min-w-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">precision_manufacturing</span>
          <span class="font-label-caps text-[12px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface">Maquinaria Propia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 min-w-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">engineering</span>
          <span class="font-label-caps text-[12px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface">Operarios Expertos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 min-w-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">sync_alt</span>
          <span class="font-label-caps text-[12px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface">Dualidad Obra &amp; Campo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/20 min-w-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl flex-shrink-0">handshake</span>
          <span class="font-label-caps text-[12px] sm:text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface">Sin Intermediarios</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- A. FUERZA MOTRIZ: TRACTORES -->
  <section id="categoria-a" class="py-16 bg-surface-container-low border-y border-outline-variant/30 scroll-mt-6">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <div class="mb-12 flex items-end justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2 block">CATEGORÍA A</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">
            FUERZA MOTRIZ: TRACTORES
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden md:block">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-outline-variant">agriculture</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Fendt 933 Vario -->
        <div class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant/20 rounded overflow-hidden flex flex-col sharp-shadow transition-transform sharp-shadow-hover">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden relative bg-surface-container-lowest">
            <img
              alt="Tractor Fendt 933 Vario"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              src="/images/maquinaria/tractor-fendt-933.webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-primary text-on-primary px-3 py-1 font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              FENDT 933 VARIO
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[22px] font-bold text-on-surface mb-3">
                Trituración y Desbroce Pesado
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                Máxima potencia para los trabajos más extremos. Tracción alemana equipada específicamente para arrastrar la fresadora <strong class="text-on-surface">FI-IVAN</strong> y la desbrozadora forestal <strong class="text-on-surface">TMC Cancela</strong> en viales de obra y acondicionamiento rústico.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                330 CV Potencia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                Fresadora FI-IVAN
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                TFT Cancela
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Fendt 930 Vario -->
        <div class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant/20 rounded overflow-hidden flex flex-col sharp-shadow transition-transform sharp-shadow-hover">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden relative bg-surface-container-lowest">
            <img
              alt="Tractor Fendt 930 Vario"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              src="/images/maquinaria/tractor-fendt-930.webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-primary text-on-primary px-3 py-1 font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              FENDT 930 VARIO
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[22px] font-bold text-on-surface mb-3">
                Molino, Topo y Desfonde Profundo
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                Fuerza de tiro constante en las profundidades del terreno. Especializado en el trabajo con <strong class="text-on-surface">molino de piedra</strong>, subsolador topo y arados de desfonde profundo para transformar fincas pedregosas en suelos productivos.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                300 CV Potencia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                Desfonde Profundo
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                Molino de Piedra
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Fendt 722 Vario -->
        <div class="bg-surface border border-outline-variant/20 rounded overflow-hidden flex flex-col sharp-shadow transition-transform sharp-shadow-hover">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden relative bg-surface-container-lowest">
            <img
              alt="Tractor Fendt 722 Vario"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              src="/images/maquinaria/tractor-fendt-722.webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-primary text-on-primary px-3 py-1 font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              FENDT 722 VARIO
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[22px] font-bold text-on-surface mb-3">
                Plantación de Precisión GPS Topcon
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                Agilidad y tecnología satelital centimétrica. Acoplado a la máquina plantadora automatizada con guiado <strong class="text-on-surface">GPS Topcon RTK</strong> para plantaciones de viña, olivar intensivo, almendros y frutales con alineación impecable.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                220 CV Potencia
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                GPS Topcon RTK
              </span>
              <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
                Viña / Olivo / Almendro
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fendt 211 Vario: Unidad Especialista a Demanda -->
      <div class="mt-8 bg-surface border border-secondary/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 aspect-[16/10] lg:aspect-auto lg:h-full bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden relative min-h-[220px]">
          <img
            alt="Tractor Fendt 211 Vario especialista en hilerado de piedras"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            src="/images/maquinaria/tractor-fendt-211.webp"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-secondary text-on-secondary px-3 py-1 font-label-caps text-label-caps rounded-xl shadow-sm">
            FENDT 211 VARIO
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">stars</span>
              <span>UNIDAD ESPECIALISTA A DEMANDA</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[22px] md:text-[26px] font-bold text-on-surface mb-3">
              Servicio Exclusivo de Hilerado de Piedras
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Tractor compacto de máxima agilidad y perfil estrecho. Diseñado para entrar en cualquier parcela o marco de plantación, se activa en ocasiones especiales para realizar labores de <strong class="text-on-surface">hilerado y acumulación de piedra superficial</strong>, dejando el terreno listo para su posterior recogida o trituración in situ.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
              110 CV Potencia
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
              Hilerador de Piedras
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-outline-variant/30">
              Maniobrabilidad Extrema
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary font-label-caps text-[10px] rounded border border-secondary/30 font-bold">
              Servicio Específico
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- B. MOVIMIENTO DE TIERRAS -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop bg-surface max-w-max-width mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2 block">CATEGORÍA B</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">
        MOVIMIENTO DE TIERRAS
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden sharp-shadow">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 relative overflow-hidden min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-[440px]">
        <img
          alt="Retropala Mixta Caterpillar 432 en vista completa"
          class="w-full h-full max-h-[420px] object-contain mix-blend-multiply hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
          src="/images/maquinaria/retropala-trinity.webp"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-8 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-center bg-surface-container-lowest border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps mb-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">forklift</span>
          EQUIPO DESTACADO
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display-lg text-[32px] md:text-[40px] leading-tight text-on-surface mb-6">
          Retropala Mixta: El comodín perfecto
        </h3>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2">OBRA CIVIL</h4>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Excavación de zanjas para canalizaciones, cimentaciones y perfilado de taludes con precisión milimétrica.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2">AGRICULTURA</h4>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Mantenimiento de redes de riego, adecuación de caminos rurales y limpieza de cunetas de drenaje.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/30">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-on-surface font-medium">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">local_shipping</span>
              Agilidad Logística garantizada
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- C. IMPLEMENTOS DUALES -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-surface-dim border-t border-outline-variant/20">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2 block">CATEGORÍA C</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface">
          IMPLEMENTOS DUALES Y PRECISIÓN
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Herramientas especializadas que acoplamos a nuestra fuerza motriz para multiplicar nuestras capacidades.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Implement 1 -->
        <div class="bg-surface rounded border border-outline-variant/20 p-1 flex flex-col group hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors sharp-shadow">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-t mb-4 bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center p-3 relative">
            <img
              alt="Fresadora FI-IVAN"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain mix-blend-multiply group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              src="/images/maquinaria/fresadora-fiivan.webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="px-4 pb-6 flex-grow">
            <span class="text-tertiary font-label-caps text-[10px] mb-2 block font-bold">TRITURACIÓN</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[20px] text-on-surface mb-2">Fresadora FI-IVAN</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-[14px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              "El Molino de Piedra". Estabilización de suelos para viales de asfalto y despedregado profundo en fincas agrícolas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Implement 2: TFT Cancela -->
        <div class="bg-surface rounded border border-outline-variant/20 p-1 flex flex-col group hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors sharp-shadow">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-t mb-4 bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center p-3 relative">
            <img
              alt="Trituradora Forestal TFT Cancela"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain mix-blend-multiply group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              src="/images/maquinaria/trituradora-forestal.webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="px-4 pb-6 flex-grow">
            <span class="text-tertiary font-label-caps text-[10px] mb-2 block font-bold">DESBROCE PESADO</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[20px] text-on-surface mb-2">TFT Cancela</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-[14px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Trituradora Forestal. Indispensable para la preparación de terrenos en parques solares y limpieza de plantaciones de frutales.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Implement 3 -->
        <div class="bg-surface rounded border border-outline-variant/20 p-1 flex flex-col group hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors sharp-shadow">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-t mb-4 bg-surface-container-lowest relative">
            <img
              alt="Guiado satelital GPS Topcon en cabina"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              src="/images/maquinaria/guiado-gps-topcon.webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="px-4 pb-6 flex-grow">
            <span class="text-tertiary font-label-caps text-[10px] mb-2 block font-bold">TECNOLOGÍA</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-[20px] text-on-surface mb-2">GPS Topcon</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-[14px] text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
              Guiado Satelital RTK. Nivelación de terrenos para topografía civil y precisión centimétrica en siembras y plantaciones.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center sharp-shadow border-2 border-primary-container/20">
      <h2 class="font-display-lg text-[32px] md:text-[48px] font-extrabold mb-4 uppercase">
        NO SOMOS INTERMEDIARIOS
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg md:text-[20px] mb-8 text-on-primary-container/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Contratar a Quintanamur S.L. significa tratar directamente con los dueños de las máquinas. Sin subcontratas, sin sobrecostes ocultos. Garantizamos compromiso total con los plazos. ¿Hablamos de tu proyecto?
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/34600000000"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 text-on-primary px-8 py-4 font-label-caps text-[14px] font-bold rounded transition-all w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm sharp-shadow"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">chat</span>
          Presupuesto por WhatsApp
        </a>
        <a
          href="tel:+34600000000"
          class="bg-transparent border-2 border-on-primary-container text-on-primary-container hover:bg-on-primary-container/10 px-8 py-4 font-label-caps text-[14px] font-bold rounded transition-all w-full sm:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">call</span>
          Llamar por Teléfono
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
